# Stripe Checkout Integration Plan

This plan outlines how to integrate **Stripe Checkout Sessions** (the recommended Stripe API for one-time payments) and **Stripe Webhooks** into the storefront using Supabase Edge Functions.

---

## 1. System Architecture

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant Edge as Supabase Edge Functions
    participant DB as Supabase DB
    participant Stripe as Stripe API

    FE->>DB: 1. Create order & pending payment
    DB-->>FE: Return payment_id
    FE->>Edge: 2. Call stripe-checkout (payment_id, cart items)
    Edge->>Stripe: 3. Create Checkout Session (with payment_id in metadata)
    Stripe-->>Edge: Return session URL
    Edge-->>FE: Return session URL
    FE->>Stripe: 4. Redirect customer to Stripe Checkout
    Stripe->>FE: 5. Redirect customer back on success/cancel
    Note over Stripe, Edge: Asynchronous Webhook Flow
    Stripe->>Edge: 6. POST checkout.session.completed (webhook)
    Edge->>DB: 7. Update payment status to 'succeeded'
    DB-->>Edge: Trigger logs payment.succeeded
```

